"""Produce and validate the unique Darwin current-release runtime evidence.

This tool deliberately owns execution, not just receipt formatting.  Every
compiler, native executable, and LLDB inspection is launched by the frozen
process-tree guard with an exact argv, exact environment, exact command digest,
and a 1 GiB sampled process-tree limit.  Darwin's userspace limit is recorded as
not_provable_userspace_poll and is never promoted to a kernel hard-limit proof.
"""

